{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24040","headline":"冬日早起闲咏 · 白居易","name":"冬日早起闲咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水塘耀初旭，风竹飘余霰。\n幽境虽目前，不因闲不见。\n晨起对炉香，道经寻两卷。\n晚坐拂琴尘，秋思弹一遍。\n此外更无事，开尊时自劝。\n何必东风来，一桮春上面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}